    "original_description": "CELDYQUE Gentle Cleanser Purifying Touch is a Korean foaming cleanser with Centella, Tea Tree, Green Tea, AHA, BHA, PHA, Sodium Hyaluronate, Collagen, Niacinamide and Allantoin for pore cleansing and sensitive-looking skin.",
    "original_ingredient_text": "Key Ingredients AHA · BHA · PHA · Centella Foaming CleanserPore CareDaily WashSoft Finish Key Ingredients: Centella Asiatica Extract, Tea Tree Extract, Green Tea Leaf Powder, Sodium Cocoyl Isethionate, Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Niacinamide and Allantoin. Benefits: Pore cleansing, exfoliation, soothing support and hydration. Formula: Lightweight foaming wash that leaves no residue. Refer to the product packaging for the complete and most current ingredient list. For external use only. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. Perform a patch test before first use. Discontinue use if persistent irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.",
